<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu rises to 4.54 per dollar from 4.59.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu rises to 4.54 per dollar from 4.59.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu rose to 4.54 per dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange, from 4.59 on Mar 26.</p>
<p>				    Mar 27	    Mar 26</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.54		4.59</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    1,300,000	 1,150,000</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
